Z||000000||Cheekisy||04-29-2001||08:32 PM||||I just bought a automatic, 4cyl, 1986 Fiero SE for $1100.  It has 146k miles on it but it doesnt seem to burn too much oil and runs pretty good.  Does anybody know any cheap and easy ways to increase horsepower, i've gotta beat one of my friends mitsubishi eclipse. thanks, J-dogg<P>p.s. already gettin a k&n air filter, which ive been told will increase power.||||reg||1
Z||000001||87GTZ34||04-29-2001||09:29 PM||||Congratulations! And welcome to the elite ranks of Fiero owners.  Also, welcome to PFF!  There is a wealth of knowledge here and many experiences and data already in the archives.  The search function has personally saved me time when troubleshooting ground that has already been covered and logged right here in PFF.<P>Again congrats and welcome to the forum.||||reg||1
